                    <TextBlock Text="后续成交关联（可选）" Style="{StaticResource EditorLabel}"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding OpportunityLinkedTradeLabel}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/><Button Content="关联档案中当前交易" Command="{Binding UseSelectedOpportunityTradeCommand}" Margin="0,5,0,3" Padding="7,5"/><Expander Header="手动填写关联编号（可选）" Margin="0,6,0,6"><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="策略版本编号；清空可解除关联" Style="{StaticResource EditorLabel}"/><TextBox Text="{Binding OpportunityPlaybook}" Style="{StaticResource CompactInput}"/><TextBlock Text="交易编号；清空可解除关联" Style="{StaticResource EditorLabel}"/><TextBox Text="{Binding OpportunityLinkedTrade}" Style="{StaticResource CompactInput}"/></StackPanel></Expander>
                    <TextBlock Text="观察与后续复盘" Style="{StaticResource EditorLabel}"/><TextBox Text="{Binding OpportunityNotes}" ToolTip="观察与后续复盘" AcceptsReturn="True" Height="85" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                    <WrapPanel Margin="0,8,0,0"><Button Content="保存机会记录" Command="{Binding SaveOpportunityCommand}" Style="{StaticResource PrimaryButtonStyle}"/><Button Content="导入机会截图" Command="{Binding ImportOpportunityAttachmentCommand}" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></WrapPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="已选记录的证据" Style="{StaticResource EditorLabel}" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
                    <ListBox ItemsSource="{Binding OpportunityAttachments}" MaxHeight="150" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling" ScrollViewer.CanContentScroll="True"><ListBox.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><Grid Margin="0,2"><Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="56"/><ColumnDefinition/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions><Image Source="{Binding Thumbnail}" Width="50" Height="38" Stretch="Uniform"/><TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding FileName}" ToolTip="{Binding Source}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" VerticalAlignment="Center"/><Button Grid.Column="2" Content="打开" Command="{Binding OpenCommand}" Padding="6,2"/><Button Grid.Column="3" Content="删除" Command="{Binding DeleteCommand}" Padding="6,2" Margin="4,0,0,0"/></Grid></DataTemplate></ListBox.ItemTemplate></ListBox>
                </StackPanel></ScrollViewer></Border>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource PageCardStyle}" Padding="8"><ListView ItemsSource="{Binding Opportunities}"><ListView.View><GridView><GridViewColumn Header="日期" Width="70" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Date}"/><GridViewColumn Header="品种" Width="85" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Symbol}"/><GridViewColumn Header="类型" Width="80" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Kind}"/><GridViewColumn Header="原因" Width="135" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Reason}"/><GridViewColumn Header="记录" Width="190" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Notes}"/><GridViewColumn Header="操作" Width="65"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><Button Content="编辑" Command="{Binding OpenCommand}" Padding="7,3" Margin="0"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn></GridView></ListView.View></ListView></Border>
            </Grid>
